# --- fromJson invalid-UTF-8 / lone-surrogate parity (issue #230 review
# round 2, finding: fromJson returned nil where Go's encoding/json
# substitutes U+FFFD). Captured 2026-07-27 from grafana/loki:3.7.4
# (go1.26.5) via /loki/api/v1/query_range: one U+FFFD per invalid BYTE
# (unquoteBytes advances DecodeRune's size-1-on-error), lone \uXXXX
# surrogate escapes become U+FFFD, valid pairs combine, an escaped
# backslash is NOT an escape, and invalid bytes OUTSIDE a string stay a
# syntax error (nil).

